  "plan": {
    "goal": "Characterize the flow regime (velocity, volume, residence time, pressure drop, Reynolds number, wall shear stress) of a 272 µm × 177 µm × 31.9 mm microfluidic channel perfused at 3.79 µL/min with medium.",
